            "id": "ev-9",
            "event_id": "WebFetch_1_c09c39f3.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "aceb7634a3d4536cf2bce0f55f4a25dde61a40c45934a18d43a460fd173eb5ae",
            "start": 9746,
            "end": 9871,
            "quote": "With versions 11.8 of the CUDA Toolkit, `nvcc` can generate cubin native to the Hopper architecture (compute capability 9.0).",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-10",
            "event_id": "WebFetch_3_c0efd86c.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "836ab2024dba8f834269cedb7883f472efa1ca2b785828fb1f9daec454d0feec",
            "start": 8400,
            "end": 8530,
            "quote": "with `HardwareCompatibilityLevel::kAMPERE_PLUS`, the check will ensure that the compute capability is greater than or equal to 8.0",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-11",
            "event_id": "WebSearch_0_4f7bc243.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "a1c9d3963574011bba620166c39b048a445b5844d9111af20db6881449d2b264",
            "start": 121,
            "end": 266,
            "quote": "[Matching CUDA arch and CUDA gencode for various NVIDIA …](https://arnon.dk/matching-sm-architectures-arch-and-gencode-for-various-nvidia-cards/)",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-12",
            "event_id": "WebSearch_2_e812b264.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "16f1687993fc4eb438c987a20d9bc0fc5986f28a3c49463804a249dd3015236a",
            "start": 138,
            "end": 226,
            "quote": "[TensorRT引擎文件跨显卡架构不兼容？从CUDA capability与 ...](https://raybyte.cn/post/2026/7/26/34f7bf39)",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-13",
            "event_id": "WebSearch_4_e0133d91.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "48d287ba2e09f32f58ecb071e8996f9f5b211d503a403e298903444ba41e730e",
            "start": 500,
            "end": 595,
            "quote": "[NVIDIA GPU 计算能力（ compute capability，SM version ...](https://www.cnblogs.com/DHclly/p/18838133)",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-14",
            "event_id": "WebSearch_0_4f7bc243.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "a1c9d3963574011bba620166c39b048a445b5844d9111af20db6881449d2b264",
            "start": 379,
            "end": 493,
            "quote": "the arch flag (‘-arch‘) specifies the name of the NVIDIA GPU architecture that the CUDA files will be compiled for",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-15",
            "event_id": "WebSearch_2_e812b264.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "16f1687993fc4eb438c987a20d9bc0fc5986f28a3c49463804a249dd3015236a",
            "start": 1245,
            "end": 1356,
            "quote": "\"Serialized engines are not portable across platforms (means Linux and Windows.) or TensorRT versions.\" (from …",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-16",
            "event_id": "client-note-00005",
            "field": "content",
            "sha256": "e201d7bd1c073270f1c2c6922f5aba2885fbb1ba848d17c56065c6fbb1b6ccc1",
            "start": 694,
            "end": 753,
            "quote": "PTX 是前向兼容的——用 `compute_70` 生成的 PTX 可以被更新架构的驱动 JIT 编译到 sm_90",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-17",
            "event_id": "client-note-00005",
            "field": "content",
            "sha256": "e201d7bd1c073270f1c2c6922f5aba2885fbb1ba848d17c56065c6fbb1b6ccc1",
            "start": 575,
            "end": 607,
            "quote": "如 CUDA 11 不支持 sm_90，需要 CUDA 12.x",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-18",
            "event_id": "WebFetch_1_c09c39f3.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "aceb7634a3d4536cf2bce0f55f4a25dde61a40c45934a18d43a460fd173eb5ae",
            "start": 4973,
            "end": 5146,
            "quote": "CUDA applications built using CUDA Toolkit 11.8 are compatible with Hopper architecture as long as they are built to include kernels in native cubin (compute capability 9.0)",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-19",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "1877bed8a023dc0502b9b031007985550b203bc7e79eba46572e636917b75019",
            "start": 3944,
            "end": 3983,
            "quote": "编译 sm_90 原生 cubin | CUDA Toolkit ≥ 11.8",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-20",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "1877bed8a023dc0502b9b031007985550b203bc7e79eba46572e636917b75019",
            "start": 4463,
            "end": 4577,
            "quote": "**未核实处**：CUDA 12.x 各版本弃用架构的精确时间线（release notes 页未含）；`kSAME_COMPUTE_CAPABILITY` 引入的具体 TensorRT 版本号；驱动最低版本号的官方表格未抓取。",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-21",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "1877bed8a023dc0502b9b031007985550b203bc7e79eba46572e636917b75019",
            "start": 629,
            "end": 855,
            "quote": "/usr/local/cuda/bin/nvcc \\\n  -gencode=arch=compute_70,code=sm_70 \\\n  -gencode=arch=compute_80,code=sm_80 \\\n  -gencode=arch=compute_90,code=sm_90 \\\n  -gencode=arch=compute_90,code=compute_90 \\\n  -O2 -o mykernel.o -c mykernel.cu",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-22",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "1877bed8a023dc0502b9b031007985550b203bc7e79eba46572e636917b75019",
            "start": 1711,
            "end": 1810,
            "quote": "验证已有二进制是否含可用 PTX：安装最新驱动后设 `CUDA_FORCE_PTX_JIT=1` 运行；能跑说明含 PTX、无需重编译即可上 Hopper，失败则必须重编译（测完记得 unset）。",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-23",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "1877bed8a023dc0502b9b031007985550b203bc7e79eba46572e636917b75019",
            "start": 2397,
            "end": 2492,
            "quote": "config.hardware_compatibility_level = trt.HardwareCompatibilityLevel.AMPERE_PLUS   # CC>=8.0 通用",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-24",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "1877bed8a023dc0502b9b031007985550b203bc7e79eba46572e636917b75019",
            "start": 491,
            "end": 532,
            "quote": "所以只含 sm_70 cubin 的二进制不能在 Hopper 上运行，必须重编译",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-25",
            "event_id": "WebFetch_1_c09c39f3.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "aceb7634a3d4536cf2bce0f55f4a25dde61a40c45934a18d43a460fd173eb5ae",
            "start": 1387,
            "end": 1495,
            "quote": "a cubin generated with compute capability 8.x is *not* supported to run on a GPU with compute capability 9.0",
            "json_escaped": false
          }
